---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import Card from "astro-theme-anu/components/Card.astro";
import CardGrid from "astro-theme-anu/components/CardGrid.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="Home">
  <h1>Computer Organisation & Program Execution</h1>
  <h2>COMP2300/6300</h2>

  <p>
    Welcome to ANU's introductory computer architecture course. In this course
    you get to take a complex computer system (the STM32L476G discovery "disco"
    board) home from week 1. You'll learn a lot about CPUs and how programs are
    organised and executed by the end of the course.
  </p>

  <p>
    This site contains all the course content: the lab content, deliverables
    (assignments), and other resources.
  </p>

  <CardGrid columns={3}>
    <Card title="Labs" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}labs/`}>
      <p>Weekly hands-on exercises with the discoboard.</p>
    </Card>
    <Card title="Deliverables" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}deliverables/`}>
      <p>Assignments and exam information.</p>
    </Card>
    <Card title="Resources" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}resources/`}>
      <p>FAQ, software setup, and reference materials.</p>
    </Card>
  </CardGrid>
</SiteLayout>
